{"id":"5736","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5736_main_altocumulus-lacunosus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这张放大的图片是相隔3分钟拍摄的两张照片的第一张。</p>\n<p>该云为网状透光高积云。网状云的特点在于其云块、云片或云层中有一些略显<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">规则排列的圆洞</span>，其中许多有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">条纹边缘</span>。</p>\n<p>图中，云块极薄，几乎没有水汽。夹卷的干燥环境空气正剧烈侵蚀云块。</p>\n<p>根据香港国际机场的观测资料及中国香港国王公园的高空探测，已将其定义为高积云属。</p>\n<p>由于该云外观持续变化，因此其编码为CM = 4。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kam Hoo Man","location":"中国，香港，屯门","latitude":"纬度: 22° 23' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 58' 21'' E","date":"17 December 2014 1630 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.13","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.13"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5737_main_altocumulus-translucidus-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>这张广角照片是相隔3分钟拍摄的两张照片中的第二张。该云是网状透光高积云。网状云的特点在于其云块、云片或云层均有一些略显规则排列的圆洞，其中许多有条纹边缘。在这张照片中，云块变薄，形成了巨大的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">不对称空隙</span>。</p>\n<p>根据香港国际机场的观测资料及中国香港国王公园的高空探测，已将其定义为高积云属。</p>\n<p>由于该云外观持续变化，因此其编码为CM = 4。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kam Hoo Man","location":"中国，香港，屯门","latitude":"纬度: 22° 23' 27'' N","longitude":"经度: 113° 58' 21'' E","date":"17 December 2014 1633 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 4, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.13","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.13"},{"src":"/images/compressed/syn/5736_syn_altocumulus-lacunosus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>强烈的冬季季风使极干燥的低空气流转向华南沿海。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 香港特别行政区政府","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5736_upper_altocumulus-lacunosus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>从地面至700 hPa极为干燥和稳定，而在640 hPa空气几乎饱和（95 %RH）</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5739_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-translucidus-lacunosus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这是一个大范围的薄高积云片，显示出大致规则分布的圆洞，其中许多圆洞带有条纹边缘。由于云的细节发生快速变化，因此该云的编码为CM = 4。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Kam Hoo Man","location":"中国，香港，元朗","latitude":"纬度: 22° 26' 40'' N","longitude":"经度: 114° 1' 20'' E","date":"27 October 2015 1139 (当地时间)","direction":"","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 4, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.13","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.13"}]},{"type":"pri","label":"1987年版图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4532_main_altocumulus-stratiformis-lacunosus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>鉴于元素的显著大小（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>），该属被鉴定为高积云。网状变种由或多或少圆形孔的存在表示（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>, <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">5</span>），透过这些孔可以看到天空。清晰定义的孔表明向下运动，可以推测整个云在不断变化。该站位于一个弱低压的南部区域。</p></div>","copyright":"© A. Simon","location":"Cairo, Egypt","latitude":"纬度: 30° 2' 40'' N","longitude":"经度: 31° 14' 9'' E","date":"17 November 1943 1302 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 4, CH= 0","code":"","imageId":""}]}]}